                "text": "13.7M people are at risk of losing their health insurance after Republicans just voted to make severe cuts to Medicaid & the Affordable Care Act. \n\nIt was a marathon 26 hour hearing and in my book, health care for our most vulnerable should always take priority over tax cuts for billionaires. \n\n@EnergyCommerce",
