                "text": "Thanks to all who came to my recent town hall, where we talked about many of your concerns including protecting government programs like Head Start and Medicaid.\n\nIn case you missed it, you can watch a full recap of the town hall at https://t.co/471YlOHToT https://t.co/woSiM4azay",
